    {
      "text": "City permit layer: H21-029 applicant listed as Jesse Loper (First Community Housing); 17,112 sq ft existing building to be demolished. Preliminary review PRE20-135 (filed 2020-10-26, status Complete) proposed 125 supportive units on 0.42 gross acres, applicant Affirmed Housing.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001956"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City permit layer: AD25-487, a Notice of Release of the AB 2162 ministerial permit H21-029 (recorded 2022-11-08 as instrument 25397706), approved 2026-01-21. NEPA review ER25-009 for the 995 East Santa Clara Street Residential project shows Under Review.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001956"
      ]
